== Effect ==
* Grants about a 5% base chance to trigger {{i|The Gamekid}} effect upon taking damage.

== Synergies ==
* {{A|Golden Trinket}} / {{i|Mom's Box|r}}: Adds additional 5% chance of triggering the {{i|The Gamekid}} effect per stack upon taking damage.

== Notes ==
* The activation chance depends on the [[luck]] stat and goes up to 100% with 38 Luck.

